<div class="work-catalog" data-work-catalog data-lang="{{ entry.lang }}">
<section class="work-heading shell"><h1>{{ 'Projelerimiz.' if not en else 'Our projects.' }}</h1><p>{{ 'Bir ihtiyacı çözmek için başladığımız, geliştirdiğimiz ve kullanıma sunduğumuz çalışmalar. Hepsi burada, bulunduğu aşamayla birlikte.' if not en else 'Work we have started, developed and launched to solve real needs. Explore every project and where it stands today.' }}</p></section>
<section class="work-layout shell" id="other" aria-label="{{ c.productList }}">
<aside class="work-sidebar"><div class="work-controls" hidden><h2>{{ 'Çalışmaları keşfet' if not en else 'Explore the work' }}</h2><div class="work-filters" role="group" aria-label="{{ 'Proje durumuna göre filtrele' if not en else 'Filter by project stage' }}"><button type="button" data-work-filter="all" aria-pressed="true"><span>{{ 'Tümü' if not en else 'All projects' }}</span><small>{{ catalog.projects.length }}</small></button>{% for group in catalog.groups %}<button type="button" data-work-filter="{{ group.id }}" aria-pressed="false"><span>{{ group.title[entry.lang] }}</span><small>{{ group.projects.length }}</small></button>{% endfor %}</div></div><nav class="work-fallback" aria-label="{{ 'Proje durumları' if not en else 'Project stages' }}">{% for group in catalog.groups %}<a href="#projects-{{ group.id }}">{{ group.title[entry.lang] }} {{ arrow() }}</a>{% endfor %}</nav><p class="work-sidebar-note">{{ 'Bazı fikirler araştırmada, bazıları günlük kullanımda. Her projenin durumunu açıkça paylaşıyoruz.' if not en else 'Some ideas are in research. Others are part of everyday use. Each project shows its current stage.' }}</p></aside>
<div class="work-results"><p class="work-result-count" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" data-work-count></p>
{% for group in catalog.groups %}<section class="work-group" id="projects-{{ group.id }}" data-work-group="{{ group.id }}"><div class="work-group-heading"><h2>{{ group.title[entry.lang] }}</h2><span data-group-count>{{ group.projects.length }} {{ 'proje' if not en else 'projects' }}</span></div>{% for project in group.projects %}<article class="work-row" data-work-project data-stage="{{ group.id }}"><div class="work-row-name"><h3>{{ project.name }}</h3><span>{{ project.status[entry.lang] }}</span></div><p>{{ project.description[entry.lang] }}</p>{% if project.detail %}<a href="{{ links.products }}{{ project.detail }}/" aria-label="{{ project.name }} · {{ c.explore }}">{{ c.explore }} {{ arrow(true) }}</a>{% elif project.url %}<a href="{{ project.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="{{ project.name }} · {{ 'Mağazada incele' if not en else 'View store listing' }}">{{ 'Mağazada incele' if not en else 'View store listing' }} {{ arrow(true) }}</a>{% else %}<span class="work-unavailable">{{ 'Henüz erişime açık değil' if not en else 'Not yet available' }}</span>{% endif %}</article>{% endfor %}</section>{% endfor %}
</div></section>
<section class="work-contact shell"><h2>{{ 'Sıradaki çalışma, sizin fikriniz olabilir.' if not en else 'Your idea could be next.' }}</h2><a class="button" href="{{ links.contact }}">{{ homepage.contact[entry.lang] }} {{ arrow() }}</a></section>
</div>
